oxicloud: {
  type: "install"
  message: <<EOM
To set up OxiCloud follow the following steps:

  1. Install PostgreSQL (check OxiCloud documentation for version requirements)
  2. Configure and start PostgreSQL, create a role for OxiCloud
  3. Enable the 'pg_trgm' and 'ltree' PostgreSQL extensions (~contrib subpackage required)
  4. Copy %%PREFIX%%/share/oxicloud/example.env to %%PREFIX%%/var/db/oxicloud/.env
  5. Read and modify the .env file according to your needs
  6. Start OxiCloud
EOM
}
